  "note": "PROPOSED for maintainer/SME sign-off (#367). Thresholds are policy proposals, not measured production performance; the 2026-09-16 stand-in numbers must not be extrapolated. Registering means setting status=registered, registered_by and registered_at in a dedicated PR BEFORE any scored run; a later change needs a new criteria_id and a new release-set manifest binding.",
